  "extractionNotes": "ZUS internal note records payment of maternity benefit for paternity leave 2026-09-14..2026-09-27 (14 days, one block); rate not printed (100% expected). The child's birth date is redacted on the ZAO and the birth extract, so event.date is absent and the case is set to adjudication mode explicitly. Full-time employment from 2024-09-01, title 0110; the ZAO statement says no paternity benefit was drawn from another title. Z-3 salary table 2025-09..2026-08 at the minimum wage of each year (4666.00, then 4806.00), all days worked, 13.71% deduction; contributionBase = column 6 (inferred). Payer up to 20 insured, so ZUS pays. Base and amounts not printed. Same leave start date as another case in this batch, probably a coincidence of anonymisation."
